            "body": "<p>Zach has practiced pharmacy since 2015, spending more than a decade in community pharmacy before moving into compounding. Years of answering questions about over-the-counter skincare and dermatologic products gave him a front-row seat to what consumers were buying, what they expected, and where those expectations often fell short. After joining The Chemist Pharmacy, he reconnected professionally with Harin, and the conversations that eventually became Chemistrie began.</p>",
