        "cred_3": {
          "type": "cred",
          "settings": {
            "number": "03",
            "title": "The Idea",
            "body": "The idea for Chemistrie became real through conversations at home. Zach's wife, Tyra, was exploring skincare while in Japan and wanted products they could make with confidence. Harin's wife was buying skincare online but faced the same problem many consumers do: endless options, complicated routines, and uncertainty about what to buy or who to trust. Harin and Zach saw an opportunity to simplify that experience with high-quality skincare, clear routines, and pharmacist-led judgment. They selected and refined the formulas with their wives in mind, then used their feedback on the products and packaging before launch."
