        "eyebrow": "Why Pharmacists",
        "heading": "Skincare doesn't need more complexity.<br/>It needs better <em>judgment.</em>",
        "body": "<p>Chemistrie was built around a simple idea: a skincare routine should be easy to understand without sacrificing quality. Our formulations begin with professionally developed PCCA formulas. Harin and Zach evaluate the available options together, prepare and critique them, and refine them where needed before selecting the final version for production. The goal is not to give customers more products. It is to give them a clear, considered routine and help them understand what they need and why.</p>"
